Scope: 
This EPD is an average EPD and applies for the following specific SINIAT produts brand developed by Etex Building Performace S.p.A: Guida PregyMetal U100/40, Guida PregyMetal U15/28, Guida PregyMetal U150/40, Guida PregyMetal U28/28, Guida PregyMetal U40/30, Guida PregyMetal U40/40, Guida PregyMetal U50/40, Guida PregyMetal U55/40, Guida PregyMetal U75/40, Montante PregyMetal C100/50, Montante PregyMetal C150/50, Montante PregyMetal C50/50, Montante PregyMetal C55/50, Montante PregyMetal C75/50, Profilo PregyMetal S4915 BA/BS, Profilo PregyMetal S4927 BA/BS, Profilo PregyMetal S6027 BA.
This EPD was developed from data collected at the Etex Building Performace S.p.A steel profile factory located in Corfinio. CAP 67030 (AQ), Italy, producing 100% of the total production of these products. Data refers to year 2021.
The EPD is a cradle-to-gate with options EPD and covers Siniat PregyMetal profiles sold in the Italian market. 
System boundary: 
This EPD is a cradle-to-gate with options EPD, covering the following life cycle stages: 

steel structures manufacturing (modules A1-A3), including the production of the steel rolls, the transport to the manufacturing site, as well as impacts due to energy consumption, as well as auxiliary materials, waste treatment;
transport of the steel structures from the manufacturing to the building site (module A4),
Installation (module A5), including the production of auxiliaries and of waste deriving from packaging;
emissions during the use phase (modules B). No emissions occur during the Etex Building Performace S.p.A steel structure use phase;
end-of-life (modules C1-C4), including impacts from manual deconstruction, transport of waste to treatment facility, and waste processing and waste disposal. The scenario studied considers 90% of the structure recyclable (C3) and 10% sent to landfill (C4);
benefits and loads beyond the system boundaries (D).
